RevokeRelayer_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not the guardian
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is the guardian
    ├── when the role is not a relayer role
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the role is a relayer role
        ├── given the account holds the role
        │   ├── it should revoke it at once
        │   └── it should emit {RoleRevoked}
        └── given the account does not hold the role
            └── it should do nothing
